    "detailed_description": "You play as a rabbit surrounded in pitch black darkness. The goal is for the rabbit to collect 100 carrots, before they dissapear, in order to escape from it. The rabbit has a hard time moving in darkness, so you will have to help navigate it towards the carrots with it's difficult moving mechanism. *angry rabbit sounds*.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nThe game includes:<br />\r\n- A rabbit (hungry)<br />\r\n- A carrot in each level<br />\r\n- A carrot counter showing how hopeless it is to clear the game<br />\r\n- A bar on each side of the screen to drag and move the rabbit<br />\r\n- Sound efffects, but no music (just use your imagination)<br />\r\n- A pinch of frustation<br />\r\n- A boring gameplay<br />\r\n- Low effort from the dev",
